  - dairy-free
tags:
  - Portugal
  - Portuguese
  - soup
servings: 4
difficulty: easy
prep time: 10 minutes
cook time: 35 minutes
created: 2026-05-20
updated: 2026-05-20
---

In a large pot with some @olive oil{}, sauté @onions{2}(roughly chopped) and @garlic{2%cloves}(crushed) for ~{5%minutes}.

Add water and @potatoes{4}(quartered). Boil for ~{20%minutes}.

In the meantime, thoroughly rinse @kale{250%g} and julienne it.

Add one quarter of the kale to the boiling vegetables and blend everything with an #immersion blender{}.

Return pot to the heat and add the remaining kale together with @chorizo{1/2}(sliced).

Cook for ~{10%minutes} more.

Season with @salt{1%tsp} and serve with a drizzle of olive oil.